WEBVTT

01:31.020 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.060 --> 01:38.020
[Episode 1]

01:41.870 --> 01:43.240
[Ningguta]

01:43.259 --> 01:45.259
[The exile land of the Qing Dynasty]

01:45.630 --> 01:46.910
[Officials convicted of heavy crimes]

01:46.910 --> 01:49.070
[Fallen princes and princesses]

01:49.100 --> 01:51.710
[Jiangnan scholars who made mistakes
in their writings]

01:51.710 --> 01:52.920
[Being imprisoned or exiled]

01:52.920 --> 01:54.640
[Along with their entire family]

01:54.640 --> 01:56.410
[After trekking thousands of miles
to this place]

01:56.410 --> 01:59.000
[They'd only have a flicker of life left]

01:59.410 --> 02:01.770
[To live here for life
as servants or laborers]

02:01.770 --> 02:03.120
[With no escape]

02:04.140 --> 02:06.670
[This is a 300-year-long frozen hell]

02:06.700 --> 02:08.229
[With no way out]

02:08.250 --> 02:10.380
[Where they could only toss and groan]

02:11.030 --> 02:12.810
[This duel on the icy river]

02:12.950 --> 02:16.220
[Was caused by an unforeseen murder]

02:24.430 --> 02:25.960
Hurry up, those in the back!

02:31.840 --> 02:33.100
Keep up, those behind!

02:48.980 --> 02:51.560
[Wu's Settlement, Ningguta]

02:52.510 --> 02:54.540
[Huang's Settlement, Ningguta]

02:59.030 --> 03:01.740
[Su Xiaohu, son of Su Shuhe]

03:02.400 --> 03:03.030
Stop!

03:15.430 --> 03:16.360
You little brat.

03:17.120 --> 03:18.280
You killed Liu Si,

03:17.200 --> 03:19.160
[Head Liu, Huang's Settlement]

03:18.560 --> 03:19.630
and you still dare to come?

03:19.630 --> 03:21.230
I'm here to avenge my father.

03:21.710 --> 03:24.110
Liu Si betrayed his group first.

03:23.450 --> 03:25.910
[Head Wang, Wu's Settlement]

03:24.400 --> 03:26.000
We won't return his body.

03:26.910 --> 03:27.910
Then let's fight.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.280
Kid!

03:31.960 --> 03:33.520
You don't need to fight today.

03:33.520 --> 03:34.520
You're too young.

03:35.360 --> 03:36.960
It's not your time to die yet.

03:39.560 --> 03:40.280
Fight!

03:40.590 --> 03:41.240
Fight!

03:56.120 --> 03:57.920
Disperse! Everyone, disperse!

03:58.470 --> 03:59.730
Put down your weapons!

03:59.870 --> 04:00.840
I said disperse!

04:01.080 --> 04:02.140
Disperse, you all!

04:13.710 --> 04:14.240
I,

04:14.430 --> 04:15.280
Gu Pingyuan,

04:15.290 --> 04:17.100
[Gu Pingyuan]

04:16.269 --> 04:17.529
was exiled to Ningguta

04:17.800 --> 04:19.920
in the fifth year of
Emperor Xianfeng's reign.

04:19.920 --> 04:20.560
Today,

04:21.310 --> 04:22.800
on the orders of the general of Ningguta,

04:22.800 --> 04:23.750
Commander Xu,

04:24.120 --> 04:25.640
I have come to mediate this matter.

04:25.640 --> 04:28.100
[Ningguta General]

04:26.120 --> 04:26.680
This

04:27.550 --> 04:30.210
is the seal of the garrison general
of Ningguta.

04:31.080 --> 04:32.070
With this seal,

04:33.040 --> 04:33.680
I can mobilize

04:33.680 --> 04:35.600
all the soldiers of the Eight Banners
in the military settlements.

04:35.600 --> 04:36.860
In this place of exile,

04:37.120 --> 04:38.870
if convicts fight and cause deaths,

04:38.870 --> 04:39.680
the officials

04:40.120 --> 04:41.650
will lose their positions,

04:42.159 --> 04:43.890
and you'll be beheaded as well!

04:44.750 --> 04:46.000
Mrs. Su and her child,

04:46.270 --> 04:47.800
and the heads of the two settlements,

04:47.800 --> 04:48.630
come to me.

04:49.270 --> 04:50.920
If I can't help you
reach an agreement today,

04:50.920 --> 04:51.680
even if those who die during your fight

04:51.680 --> 04:52.990
fill this river,

04:53.630 --> 04:55.159
I won't intervene anymore!

04:59.860 --> 05:03.630
[Three days ago]

05:04.750 --> 05:05.750
Make sure to request me again.

05:04.790 --> 05:08.460
[Manchun Brothel, Ningguta]

05:05.830 --> 05:06.360
Okay, I will.

05:06.360 --> 05:07.600
If you don't, I'll be mad at you.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.660
Alright, alright.

05:12.190 --> 05:12.600
Mr. Gu.

05:12.600 --> 05:13.160
Sir.

05:13.270 --> 05:14.430
For 3 coppers, I'll sing you
an excerpt with instruments

05:14.430 --> 05:15.680
from "Romance of the Western Chamber,"

05:15.680 --> 05:17.740
the "Bustling Fifth Watch" section.

05:19.360 --> 05:21.750
♪ In the first watch, Zhang the scholar ♪

05:21.950 --> 05:24.120
♪ Jumped over the powdered wall ♪

05:24.190 --> 05:25.120
Mr. Gu.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.560
Mr. Gu, please don't leave.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.020
Mr. Gu, come have some fun.

05:30.560 --> 05:31.190
Mr. Gu.

05:31.430 --> 05:32.190
You're here.

05:32.680 --> 05:33.190
Come on.

05:33.240 --> 05:34.159
Please come on in.

05:34.159 --> 05:34.830
This way, please.

05:34.830 --> 05:37.290
They're all waiting for you
in the backyard.

05:37.920 --> 05:38.510
This way.

05:47.159 --> 05:48.560
Who are all these people?

05:48.560 --> 05:50.310
Big pharmaceutical merchants from
both south and north of the Yangtze River.

05:50.310 --> 05:52.270
They're all from big pharmacies like
Guangzhou's Heng Foh Tong Medical Hall,

05:52.270 --> 05:53.480
Beijing's Tong Ren Tang Medical Hall,

05:53.480 --> 05:55.190
and Hangzhou's Hu Qing Yu Tang Pharmacy.

05:55.190 --> 05:57.270
A big boss has also come.

05:57.430 --> 05:58.190
He's the

05:58.190 --> 06:01.070
young heir of
200 franchise pharmacies nationwide.

06:01.070 --> 06:02.200
Is the item genuine?

06:02.240 --> 06:02.680
Sure!

06:02.920 --> 06:03.680
Of course it's genuine.

06:03.680 --> 06:04.240
It was obtained by

06:04.240 --> 06:05.950
Liu Si from Huang's Settlement

06:05.950 --> 06:07.600
and Su Shuhe from Wu's Settlement.

06:07.600 --> 06:08.870
They dug it up together.

06:08.870 --> 06:10.060
For this ginseng,

06:10.120 --> 06:12.000
they lived in trees
for almost half a year.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.480
Finally, they got a chance.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.450
They tied up the ginseng doll

06:15.510 --> 06:17.140
with a red rope soaked in cinnabar.

06:17.140 --> 06:18.360
With two embroidery needles,

06:18.360 --> 06:19.560
piercing from front to back,

06:19.560 --> 06:21.240
they fixed the ginseng doll in place.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.240
You know what?

06:22.310 --> 06:23.160
When they brought this ginseng back,

06:23.160 --> 06:24.920
it still had flowers and leaves on it.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.720
It looked exactly

06:25.720 --> 06:26.950
like a little person.

06:27.000 --> 06:27.950
The eyes and nose

06:28.120 --> 06:29.450
were so clear and vivid.

06:30.830 --> 06:31.960
That mouth of yours.

06:32.000 --> 06:32.750
Find a master

06:33.040 --> 06:34.900
and learn storytelling instead.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.580
100 taels for appraising.

06:36.830 --> 06:38.040
I only accept cash,

06:38.670 --> 06:40.920
[Exile, Su Shuhe]

06:39.120 --> 06:41.650
and banknotes
from the Four Major Banks only.

06:51.950 --> 06:53.659
Name your price, please.

06:53.870 --> 06:55.120
I only handle the appraising,

06:55.120 --> 06:56.070
not the pricing.

06:56.750 --> 06:57.370
Leave.

06:57.480 --> 06:58.340
Leave already.

06:58.720 --> 06:59.630
Name a price.

06:59.950 --> 07:00.800
Didn't I ask you

07:00.800 --> 07:01.930
to come in one by one?

07:01.950 --> 07:02.680
Get out!

07:02.870 --> 07:03.530
Who are you?

07:04.120 --> 07:05.780
He was talking to you. Get out.

07:08.870 --> 07:10.000
Mr. Gu, you're here.

07:11.600 --> 07:12.390
Two exiles

07:12.480 --> 07:14.410
pretending to be big shots with me!

07:14.560 --> 07:15.720
Listen, Mr. Chen,

07:15.950 --> 07:16.920
if you want to do business here,

07:16.920 --> 07:18.650
you really can't bypass Mr. Gu.

07:19.070 --> 07:20.070
Didn't you buy

07:20.120 --> 07:21.390
a fourth-rank official's hat?

07:21.390 --> 07:23.120
If you wear that official's outfit
over there,

07:23.120 --> 07:24.360
I bet in the entire Ningguta,

07:24.360 --> 07:26.270
they won't find an official
as high-ranking as that.

07:26.270 --> 07:28.200
Who doesn't know that on this land,

07:28.270 --> 07:30.870
money is more powerful
than an official's hat?

07:31.040 --> 07:31.720
Anyway,

07:32.070 --> 07:34.870
we all have to rely on
our own financial strengths.

07:35.510 --> 07:37.640
I'm afraid no one will be able to buy it.

07:39.950 --> 07:41.210
Who is this gentleman?

07:41.630 --> 07:42.600
Talking behind

07:42.600 --> 07:43.270
the screen.

07:46.560 --> 07:47.159
Everyone.

07:47.340 --> 07:49.710
[Butler of the Li Family in the capital,
Zhang Guangfa]

07:47.510 --> 07:48.110
Everyone.

07:48.920 --> 07:49.950
This is the young heir

07:49.950 --> 07:51.600
of the Li family in our capital.

07:51.600 --> 07:53.190
It's his first time
traveling far from home.

07:53.190 --> 07:54.560
Please don't take any offense.

07:54.560 --> 07:56.290
Please don't take any offense.

07:57.159 --> 07:58.480
Li Wantang's son?

07:58.870 --> 07:59.730
Let me tell you.

08:00.040 --> 08:00.710
This thing,

08:01.160 --> 08:02.820
we're definitely getting it.

08:07.010 --> 08:10.310
[Young Master of the Li family
in the capital, Li Qin]

08:12.630 --> 08:13.470
You,

08:13.500 --> 08:14.830
get on the ship and check

08:15.680 --> 08:17.160
how much cash we have left.

08:17.750 --> 08:19.160
If there's enough,

08:20.240 --> 08:22.430
let's have a competition with them today.

08:22.430 --> 08:24.390
That Xu is really sharp.

08:25.190 --> 08:27.050
He's already trying to take a cut.

08:28.270 --> 08:30.200
I haven't even sold this thing yet.

08:31.040 --> 08:31.600
You know

08:31.600 --> 08:33.600
what kind of person Commander Xu is.

08:34.240 --> 08:35.669
Even if a manure cart passes by the door,

08:35.669 --> 08:37.240
he'll stop to check it out.

08:37.890 --> 08:39.490
Your precious ginseng doll

08:40.669 --> 08:42.270
has caused such a stir

08:42.669 --> 08:44.270
in Ningguta,

08:45.240 --> 08:47.240
so of course he had to send me here
to keep an eye on it.

08:47.240 --> 08:48.040
I believe you.

08:49.440 --> 08:50.570
Do you want to see it?

08:51.200 --> 08:51.720
No need.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.080
When you make the transaction,

08:53.080 --> 08:54.280
I'll take a look then.

08:54.600 --> 08:55.630
I'm just curious.

08:56.200 --> 08:57.260
Why are you willing

08:57.480 --> 08:59.010
to risk your life this time?

09:01.080 --> 09:02.840
My life is pretty much over.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.450
But I can't let my son

09:04.670 --> 09:06.330
spend his whole life in exile.

09:08.780 --> 09:09.840
I've found a way

09:10.270 --> 09:11.330
to help him escape,

09:12.550 --> 09:14.010
then he can change his name

09:14.200 --> 09:15.600
and find a place to study.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.800
He's already 9 years old now.

09:18.000 --> 09:20.150
He brandishes weapons with me every day,

09:20.150 --> 09:23.350
insisting on going up the mountain
with me to dig ginseng.

09:25.510 --> 09:26.840
It's my fault.

09:30.790 --> 09:31.360
If you can

09:31.360 --> 09:33.090
really get your son out of here,

09:33.600 --> 09:35.060
this deal will be worth it.

09:36.270 --> 09:37.270
Is the channel reliable?

09:37.270 --> 09:37.930
It's solid.

09:38.550 --> 09:39.880
Once that thing is sold,

09:40.030 --> 09:41.560
I won't owe Commander Xu

09:41.910 --> 09:42.790
a single cent.

09:43.320 --> 09:45.320
The rest will be split
between me and Si.

09:45.320 --> 09:47.320
What price do you want to sell it for?

09:47.510 --> 09:48.390
At least

09:50.240 --> 09:50.910
100,000.

09:53.440 --> 09:54.300
That's too low.

09:58.870 --> 09:59.360
Mr. Gu,

09:59.510 --> 10:00.250
you're here.

10:00.440 --> 10:01.160
Si.

10:01.600 --> 10:03.400
Had a few drinks. Sorry I'm late.

10:03.480 --> 10:04.320
I was just

10:04.510 --> 10:05.950
discussing with Su.

10:06.510 --> 10:07.200
This thing,

10:07.870 --> 10:09.870
what price do you plan to sell it for?

10:11.670 --> 10:13.070
We can sell it for 80,000,

10:13.200 --> 10:14.440
or 100,000.

10:14.840 --> 10:16.040
Even 800,000 will do.

10:17.320 --> 10:19.360
Four young men from our settlement
have died.

10:19.360 --> 10:20.320
Their parents

10:19.400 --> 10:22.080
[Exile Liu Si]

10:20.440 --> 10:22.700
are all demanding compensation from us.

10:24.550 --> 10:25.080
Alright,

10:25.670 --> 10:26.800
I'll go talk to them.

10:28.750 --> 10:30.280
Thank you for your trouble.

10:34.200 --> 10:34.800
Everyone,

10:35.770 --> 10:37.390
-I'm Gu Pingyuan. My respects.
-Mr. Gu.

10:37.390 --> 10:37.890
Mr. Gu.

10:38.750 --> 10:39.650
We have both

10:39.790 --> 10:41.870
old acquaintances
and new friends here today.

10:41.870 --> 10:44.390
Although it's said that
the roads of the world are open to all,

10:44.390 --> 10:45.490
there's an unshakable law

10:45.490 --> 10:46.620
of the Qing Dynasty:

10:47.240 --> 10:49.600
Han people are not allowed
to enter the borders for even a step.

10:49.600 --> 10:50.860
We're all in a business

10:51.360 --> 10:52.960
that could cost us our heads.

10:53.720 --> 10:55.080
I'm here only to make sure

10:55.080 --> 10:55.840
everyone can

10:55.870 --> 10:57.150
get their deal done

10:57.510 --> 10:58.560
and to keep anyone from

10:58.560 --> 11:00.760
being picked apart by the authorities.

11:00.910 --> 11:01.910
Please, go ahead.

11:06.910 --> 11:07.770
Where's Liu Si?

11:08.510 --> 11:10.150
He went home to check on his son.

11:10.150 --> 11:12.080
He said that with you handling things,
Mr. Gu,

11:12.080 --> 11:13.010
he can rest easy.

11:13.360 --> 11:14.760
He really trusts me, huh?

11:19.440 --> 11:20.120
Everyone,

11:20.960 --> 11:22.480
let's start the open bidding.

11:22.480 --> 11:23.880
The highest bidder wins.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.220
10,000, calling once.

11:26.840 --> 11:27.390
50,000.

11:27.910 --> 11:28.510
80,000.

11:28.720 --> 11:29.390
100,000.

11:29.720 --> 11:30.690
190,000 taels.

11:30.790 --> 11:32.200
We haven't even seen the item yet,

11:32.200 --> 11:34.390
and the bidding has already gone
this high.

11:34.390 --> 11:35.270
220,000.

11:37.630 --> 11:38.750
250,000.

11:42.600 --> 11:43.550
270,000.

11:45.000 --> 11:45.600
Who was it?

11:45.910 --> 11:47.040
Who called 270,000?

11:47.720 --> 11:48.600
280,000.

11:51.150 --> 11:52.070
290,000.

11:52.440 --> 11:53.590
300,000.

11:54.370 --> 11:55.080
Hey,

11:55.360 --> 11:57.240
your butler hasn't even returned yet.

11:57.240 --> 11:58.770
Do you even have that money?

12:00.480 --> 12:01.940
There's money on the ship.

12:03.150 --> 12:04.610
There's money on the ship?

12:05.030 --> 12:05.550
Kid.

12:05.750 --> 12:06.960
Today, I, Old Man,

12:07.030 --> 12:08.270
will teach you a lesson.

12:08.270 --> 12:09.270
Your father sent you out

12:09.270 --> 12:10.360
to gain experience,

12:10.360 --> 12:11.030
not to

12:11.080 --> 12:12.200
come here and cause trouble.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.240
-Stop it.
-Stop fooling around.

12:13.240 --> 12:13.750
If your Li family

12:13.750 --> 12:15.080
were serious about doing business,

12:15.080 --> 12:16.360
your father wouldn't have sent you here.

12:16.360 --> 12:17.560
Stop fooling around.

12:17.750 --> 12:18.610
Listen to that.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.080
Stop messing around.

12:20.080 --> 12:20.940
What nonsense.

12:21.080 --> 12:21.610
Alright.

12:23.200 --> 12:24.580
It's yours then.

12:25.120 --> 12:26.200
Thanks then.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.470
These are notes from the Four Major Banks.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.750
Please verify them.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.870
Looks solid to me.

12:41.150 --> 12:41.750
You check.

12:59.470 --> 13:00.590
This ginseng doll

13:01.870 --> 13:02.790
is now yours.

13:04.670 --> 13:05.270
Thank you.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.330
Bring out that treasure

13:09.510 --> 13:10.940
and let us have a look too.

13:10.970 --> 13:11.550
Show us.

13:11.960 --> 13:12.820
I want to see it.

13:14.630 --> 13:15.630
Let us have a look.

13:17.720 --> 13:18.510
Where's the item?

13:18.510 --> 13:19.640
There's no ginseng.

13:19.960 --> 13:21.240
There's nothing in there.

13:21.240 --> 13:21.970
Where is it?

13:22.670 --> 13:23.530
-It's empty.
-What's going on?

13:23.530 --> 13:24.190
It's empty.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.580
There's nothing in it.

13:26.120 --> 13:27.120
Where's the item?

13:27.400 --> 13:27.870
Exactly.

13:27.870 --> 13:29.330
-Where is it?
-Where is it?

13:31.720 --> 13:32.850
How did this happen?

13:33.450 --> 13:34.710
Isn't this a scam?

13:34.730 --> 13:35.270
Exactly.

13:36.240 --> 13:36.870
You, Su!

13:38.870 --> 13:40.470
Where's that thing I bought?

13:42.150 --> 13:43.150
Is it on you?

13:43.690 --> 13:44.150
Right, right.

13:44.150 --> 13:45.880
-Open up your coat.
-Open it up.

13:46.000 --> 13:47.600
Open up your coat and show us.

13:59.670 --> 14:01.600
I've walked on the edge of the blade

14:01.650 --> 14:03.000
for my entire life,

14:04.150 --> 14:06.150
and I've never uttered a single lie.

14:06.790 --> 14:07.360
Su.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.000
Are you sure that when Si left,

14:10.000 --> 14:11.860
that ginseng was still in the box?

14:12.360 --> 14:13.120
I never saw him

14:13.120 --> 14:14.670
take it out of the box.

14:14.960 --> 14:15.890
It must be there.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.920
How could it just disappear?

14:22.960 --> 14:26.560
I really should have checked the almanac
before going out today.

14:26.770 --> 14:27.580
You, Su.

14:28.240 --> 14:29.500
I, Old Man,

14:29.720 --> 14:30.960
have been in this business
for so many years,

14:30.960 --> 14:31.750
and I've never seen anyone as

14:31.750 --> 14:32.750
dishonest as you!

14:33.240 --> 14:34.120
All that nonsense about the ginseng doll

14:34.120 --> 14:34.910
and the Mountain God—

14:34.910 --> 14:35.750
you guys are just making things up

14:35.750 --> 14:37.150
and openly deceiving me!

14:37.600 --> 14:38.530
I didn't take it.

14:39.120 --> 14:39.940
If I were to believe you,

14:39.940 --> 14:40.870
once I leave this place,

14:40.870 --> 14:42.270
would you still admit it?

14:42.440 --> 14:43.440
My entire family would end up

14:43.440 --> 14:45.370
having to jump in the river, right?

14:46.430 --> 14:48.140
You liars! So despicable!

14:48.480 --> 14:49.610
They are all cheats!

14:49.660 --> 14:51.990
Ningguta has always been a den of bandits!

14:52.270 --> 14:53.270
Let's go! Come on.

14:53.510 --> 14:54.030
Let's go!

14:54.030 --> 14:54.960
I didn't take it!

14:55.200 --> 14:56.330
Stop! Nobody leave!

15:01.150 --> 15:01.750
Everyone,

15:02.120 --> 15:04.120
I've never told a single lie.

15:07.670 --> 15:09.390
This afternoon I saw with my own eyes

15:09.390 --> 15:10.990
that the item was in this box.

15:11.270 --> 15:13.470
I can't really explain what's going on.

15:14.030 --> 15:14.630
Mr. Gu.

15:16.510 --> 15:17.640
Please vouch for me.

15:21.480 --> 15:22.080
Su.

15:23.260 --> 15:24.060
Don't be rash.

15:26.030 --> 15:27.090
Put the knife down.

15:31.630 --> 15:32.430
You and Liu Si,

15:32.470 --> 15:34.400
what exactly are you two planning?

15:34.910 --> 15:36.970
Couldn't you have told me in advance?

15:37.790 --> 15:39.290
How am I supposed to help you now?

15:39.290 --> 15:41.020
That's not how you do business.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.480
I do business.

15:46.510 --> 15:47.870
I do business?

15:50.390 --> 15:52.920
Tell me, what kind of business
am I doing here?

15:54.150 --> 15:55.150
I've ruined

15:55.150 --> 15:56.720
my whole life,

15:58.150 --> 16:00.600
and now my son has no way out either.

16:01.790 --> 16:03.480
I regret it.

16:06.590 --> 16:07.360
Everyone,

16:08.400 --> 16:11.150
I'll make sure you all leave here
with peace of mind today.

16:11.150 --> 16:11.750
Mr. Gu.

16:12.360 --> 16:13.030
Trust me.

16:18.600 --> 16:19.530
This... This...

16:20.150 --> 16:21.690
Although the deal fell through,

16:21.690 --> 16:22.670
he didn't have to commit suicide, right?

16:22.670 --> 16:23.410
To prove his innocence,

16:23.410 --> 16:24.510
this is too extreme.

16:24.510 --> 16:25.750
What about his child?

16:25.960 --> 16:27.490
It's still a life after all.

16:30.550 --> 16:31.610
Let's go. Let's go.

16:32.840 --> 16:33.370
Let's go.

16:53.270 --> 16:54.150
Su,

16:57.840 --> 16:58.640
I promise you,

17:01.080 --> 17:02.810
I will get to the bottom of this.

17:04.550 --> 17:06.010
I won't let you die in vain.

17:14.599 --> 17:17.680
[Ningguta Garrison General's Mansion]

17:22.250 --> 17:24.040
Why is there another death?

17:24.400 --> 17:25.790
What about it?

17:26.000 --> 17:27.730
He was just an exiled criminal.

17:27.920 --> 17:28.590
His death is no more significant

17:28.590 --> 17:29.920
than stepping on an ant.

17:30.030 --> 17:30.830
Commander Xu.

17:31.720 --> 17:33.510
This is a serious matter.

17:33.640 --> 17:35.960
That condemned official surnamed Su

17:36.350 --> 17:39.400
used to be
a second-rank military attaché.

17:36.530 --> 17:39.260
[Magistrate Wang, Ningguta Magistrate]

17:41.190 --> 17:43.160
[Xu San, Ningguta Garrison General]

17:44.310 --> 17:46.710
Even if he had been ranked up
to the heavens,

17:47.000 --> 17:49.680
in Ningguta, he was nothing
but a notorious criminal.

17:49.680 --> 17:52.520
But he was exiled here

17:52.590 --> 17:54.110
after losing a battle in Nanjing.

17:54.110 --> 17:56.720
You never know
when the Emperor might remember him

17:56.720 --> 17:58.410
and reinstate him.

17:58.790 --> 18:00.510
Where would that leave us?

18:00.880 --> 18:02.440
Hurry up and send someone smart

18:02.440 --> 18:03.400
to the settlement

18:03.400 --> 18:05.000
to stabilize the situation.

18:05.240 --> 18:06.270
Gu Pingyuan!

18:11.240 --> 18:12.700
Greetings, Commander Xu.

18:13.110 --> 18:14.570
Greetings, Your Worship.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.590
What exactly happened?

18:17.160 --> 18:17.680
I initially thought

18:17.680 --> 18:18.940
Liu Si was behind this.

18:19.420 --> 18:20.720
Last night, he left in a hurry,

18:20.720 --> 18:22.310
using his son's illness as an excuse.

18:22.310 --> 18:22.940
However,

18:23.270 --> 18:24.670
Su said before he died

18:24.720 --> 18:26.440
that Liu Si never opened the box.

18:26.440 --> 18:28.240
It's possible that before the bidding,

18:28.240 --> 18:30.240
the ginseng had already been taken.

18:30.510 --> 18:32.740
So, in the midst of
all this truth and falsehood,

18:32.740 --> 18:34.920
I can't figure it out
for the time being, either.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.360
It's indeed odd.

18:37.460 --> 18:38.790
I have a task for you.

18:39.070 --> 18:41.730
Magistrate Wang will personally
instruct you.

18:43.000 --> 18:44.310
As you command, Your Worship.

18:44.310 --> 18:45.970
Investigating the whereabouts
of the ginseng

18:45.970 --> 18:47.310
is certainly important,

18:47.310 --> 18:48.790
but the cause of Su's death

18:48.790 --> 18:49.830
cannot be treated carelessly.

18:49.830 --> 18:51.730
It must be convincing.

18:52.160 --> 18:53.640
Moreover, everyone,

18:53.680 --> 18:55.960
from top to bottom,
must have a unified story.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.720
This matter must not jeopardize

18:57.720 --> 18:59.850
Commander Xu's and my future careers.

19:00.830 --> 19:01.690
Young man.

19:02.270 --> 19:04.670
Make sure to comfort Su's family properly.

19:05.440 --> 19:06.160
In short,

19:06.750 --> 19:09.200
peace and no trouble is the best outcome.

19:09.720 --> 19:10.240
Yes.

19:18.200 --> 19:19.650
This subordinate of yours

19:19.650 --> 19:20.400
truly looks like

19:20.400 --> 19:22.200
someone who can get things done.

19:22.590 --> 19:23.550
This guy,

19:24.160 --> 19:25.200
I have to

19:25.200 --> 19:27.860
keep one eye open watching him
even when I sleep.

19:28.240 --> 19:30.090
A mere scholar,

19:30.240 --> 19:33.440
unable to lift with his shoulders
or carry with his hands,

19:34.480 --> 19:36.410
yet within dozens of miles around,

19:37.550 --> 19:39.010
just by invoking his name,

19:40.270 --> 19:42.160
convicts from more than a dozen villages
outside the city

19:42.160 --> 19:43.890
would risk their lives for him.

19:44.900 --> 19:48.200
[Wu's Settlement, Ningguta]

19:45.000 --> 19:46.730
-Hello, Mr. Gu.
-Hello, Mr. Gu.

19:47.110 --> 19:47.720
Mr. Gu.

19:48.590 --> 19:50.200
-Hello, Mr. Gu.
-Hello, Mr. Gu.

19:50.200 --> 19:51.000
Hello, Mr. Gu.

19:51.310 --> 19:51.680
Hello, Mr. Gu.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.080
Mr. Gu.

19:52.350 --> 19:53.970
Hello, Mr. Gu. Hello, Mr. Gu.

19:58.590 --> 19:59.310
Mr. Gu!

19:59.510 --> 20:01.120
Twenty large coins!

20:01.270 --> 20:02.600
Mr. Gu, this way please.

20:08.310 --> 20:09.400
♪ As the big drum beats ♪

20:09.400 --> 20:10.680
♪ It goes ding-dong like this ♪

20:10.680 --> 20:12.610
♪ This time, we've lit three lamps ♪

20:12.640 --> 20:13.690
♪ Three lamps ♪

20:13.790 --> 20:16.480
♪ If you're willing, respond to us ♪

20:16.750 --> 20:17.280
Alright!

20:17.510 --> 20:19.070
The filial son, light the lamps!

20:19.070 --> 20:20.000
Light the lamps!

20:20.110 --> 20:22.910
♪ If the old immortal hears us ♪

20:23.070 --> 20:24.920
♪ Don't talk about taking the main road ♪

20:24.920 --> 20:25.750
♪ Crossing the wheel tracks ♪

20:25.750 --> 20:26.510
♪ Or taking the small road ♪

20:26.510 --> 20:27.750
♪ Where there's plenty of dew ♪

20:27.750 --> 20:29.400
♪ Through wilderness,
pulling grass in barren lands ♪

20:28.000 --> 20:30.210
[Mrs. Su, Su Shuhe's Wife]

20:29.590 --> 20:31.340
♪ The journey is full of hardships ♪

20:31.340 --> 20:33.110
-♪ Though there are hardships ♪
-Sorry for your loss, Mrs. Su.

20:33.110 --> 20:35.110
♪ Put the hardships and toil aside
for now ♪

20:35.110 --> 20:36.770
-♪ The sorghum field ♪
-Mr. Gu.

20:36.960 --> 20:37.750
My husband

20:37.750 --> 20:39.210
died right in front of you,

20:39.680 --> 20:40.350
didn't he?

20:42.270 --> 20:42.750
Yes.

20:43.790 --> 20:45.360
So, when he died...

20:47.030 --> 20:47.830
Did it hurt?

20:51.920 --> 20:53.720
One stab right through the heart.

20:53.720 --> 20:54.580
It didn't hurt.

21:05.100 --> 21:05.550
Mr. Gu.

21:12.070 --> 21:12.720
Mr. Gu.

21:13.400 --> 21:14.130
Want a drink?

21:15.680 --> 21:16.510
Why did you leave early yesterday

21:16.510 --> 21:17.310
for no reason?

21:20.420 --> 21:21.310
Si's son

21:21.460 --> 21:23.860
died of twisted bowel syndrome yesterday.

21:25.000 --> 21:25.720
He died?

21:29.790 --> 21:30.410
Mr. Gu.

21:30.960 --> 21:31.690
You're here.

21:36.350 --> 21:37.390
Kind gentlemen.

21:37.830 --> 21:39.690
Please, sit down and have a drink.

21:39.790 --> 21:40.510
Mr. Gu.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.490
I feel troubled inside.

21:42.920 --> 21:43.750
You know, if it weren't for

21:43.750 --> 21:45.150
those harsh words I said,

21:45.680 --> 21:47.200
he wouldn't have died, right?

21:47.200 --> 21:48.460
Don't blame yourself.

21:48.750 --> 21:50.160
His death had nothing to do with you.

21:50.160 --> 21:52.200
Wasn't he said to be
from a military background?

21:52.200 --> 21:54.350
He had faced
thousands of troops in battle,

21:54.350 --> 21:56.370
yet he couldn't handle a few harsh words?

21:56.370 --> 21:57.720
Don't overthink it.

22:02.960 --> 22:04.180
Well said, Sir.

22:05.480 --> 22:06.700
May I ask your name?

22:07.160 --> 22:08.350
Li Qin.

22:08.750 --> 22:10.790
The "Li" from the four major surnames,
Zhao, Qian, Sun, and Li,

22:10.790 --> 22:13.190
and the "Qin" from "respectfully comply."

22:13.240 --> 22:14.310
I am Gu Pingyuan.

22:15.160 --> 22:17.310
The "Gu" from "I don't believe there're
no sages like ancient times today,"

22:17.310 --> 22:18.310
and

22:19.070 --> 22:21.200
the "Pingyuan" from "Lord Pingyuan."

22:22.640 --> 22:24.270
May I ask about your family background?

22:24.270 --> 22:25.440
My father's first name

22:25.440 --> 22:26.920
is Wantang.

22:27.550 --> 22:28.880
A small-time merchant.

22:29.070 --> 22:30.920
Li Wantang from the capital city.

22:30.920 --> 22:32.790
If he were to be considered
just a small-time merchant,

22:32.790 --> 22:35.550
then there would be no big merchants
in this world.

22:35.550 --> 22:37.420
These people who came today

22:38.350 --> 22:40.350
are all here to watch the commotion,

22:41.720 --> 22:42.980
except for you, Mr. Li.

22:44.350 --> 22:45.640
If I remember correctly,

22:45.640 --> 22:46.920
you came with a butler.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.880
Where is your butler?

22:49.240 --> 22:50.310
He had our household matters to attend to.

22:50.310 --> 22:51.110
What matters?

22:52.350 --> 22:53.610
Recently in Ningguta,

22:53.750 --> 22:56.410
all checkpoints and docks
have been sealed off.

22:56.790 --> 22:57.850
How did your butler

22:58.240 --> 22:58.960
know something happened

22:58.960 --> 23:00.070
back at home?

23:00.790 --> 23:02.450
Could he be some kind of deity,

23:02.480 --> 23:03.940
able to divine the future?

23:04.440 --> 23:05.570
He's in poor health.

23:06.000 --> 23:07.550
Traveling secretly on a snowy night.

23:07.550 --> 23:09.610
The ancients called this "fleeing."

23:09.720 --> 23:11.310
What serious illness does he have

23:11.310 --> 23:12.710
that allows him to manage

23:13.110 --> 23:14.590
a night escape in the snow?

23:15.310 --> 23:16.550
It's unheard of.

23:20.590 --> 23:22.790
If you dare to leave, I'll dare to shout.

23:27.960 --> 23:30.350
But you have no proof.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.270
What do you want?

23:35.510 --> 23:37.240
Yesterday, your butler

23:37.590 --> 23:39.570
took the opportunity to meet Liu Si

23:40.030 --> 23:42.000
when he went to get money from the ship.

23:42.000 --> 23:43.680
The girls in the brothel said so.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.540
It must be true.

23:45.790 --> 23:47.720
So that's how you do business, huh?

23:49.350 --> 23:50.950
Of course the butler did that

23:51.000 --> 23:52.860
under my father's instructions.

23:53.480 --> 23:55.280
I didn't agree with it, you know.

23:57.880 --> 23:58.960
I thought so.

23:59.680 --> 24:01.010
If it were a conspiracy,

24:01.650 --> 24:03.200
why would the butler
leave the master behind

24:03.200 --> 24:04.200
to take the blame?

24:07.110 --> 24:08.040
You don't have to

24:08.070 --> 24:09.790
grieve too much

24:09.830 --> 24:11.200
over your friend Su's death.

24:11.200 --> 24:13.550
Such a precious treasure
as the ginseng doll

24:13.550 --> 24:15.640
should never have been harvested
in the first place.

24:15.640 --> 24:17.750
And it shouldn't have fallen into
their hands.

24:17.750 --> 24:18.830
As the saying goes,

24:19.030 --> 24:21.560
"a gentleman's only crime
is to carry a jade."

24:21.590 --> 24:23.520
His acquisition of such a treasure

24:23.830 --> 24:24.830
was a misfortune,

24:25.750 --> 24:26.610
not a blessing.

24:44.440 --> 24:46.500
♪ The bereaved returns the courtesy ♪

24:54.960 --> 24:55.790
Gu.

24:56.790 --> 24:57.850
When I respect you,

24:57.950 --> 24:59.110
I call you Mr. Gu.

25:00.160 --> 25:01.640
But when I no longer want to respect you,

25:01.640 --> 25:02.270
you're be nothing more than

25:02.270 --> 25:03.640
a dog of Commander Xu.

25:08.150 --> 25:09.000
You dare kick me?

25:09.000 --> 25:10.190
I'll kill you!

25:13.120 --> 25:14.850
You might as well go a bit lower.

25:15.890 --> 25:16.680
Between the third

25:16.680 --> 25:18.330
and fourth rib.

25:19.350 --> 25:21.410
That's where the knife was stabbed in

25:21.510 --> 25:22.960
when Su killed himself.

25:24.070 --> 25:25.160
Clean and swift.

25:26.880 --> 25:27.680
I don't know how

25:27.680 --> 25:28.880
your heart is formed.

25:29.110 --> 25:30.350
He was such a good man.

25:31.070 --> 25:32.590
How could you bear to betray him?

25:32.590 --> 25:34.120
I didn't do it!

25:34.440 --> 25:35.740
I never took any money!

25:35.790 --> 25:37.400
Say that again, and I'll kill you!

25:37.400 --> 25:38.270
Even when he was dying,

25:38.270 --> 25:39.880
he didn't blame you once.

25:41.310 --> 25:43.110
Didn't you say your son was dead?

25:44.590 --> 25:45.120
Alright,

25:46.070 --> 25:47.160
bring out his body

25:47.160 --> 25:48.420
for me to see right now.

25:48.920 --> 25:49.590
If there is,

25:50.110 --> 25:51.680
you can stab me

25:51.680 --> 25:52.960
as many times as you want.

25:52.960 --> 25:54.200
If I even frown,

25:54.720 --> 25:55.720
I'm not a real man.

25:57.510 --> 25:58.170
Do you dare?

26:01.200 --> 26:03.600
I really didn't do it.

26:03.640 --> 26:06.050
Why won't you believe me?

26:06.310 --> 26:07.910
That young heir named Li Qin,

26:08.480 --> 26:09.680
his butler left the city

26:09.680 --> 26:10.880
last night in a hurry,

26:11.310 --> 26:12.840
taking your child with him,

26:14.110 --> 26:14.640
right?

26:15.770 --> 26:16.830
You want to kill me?

26:18.070 --> 26:18.870
It's useless.

26:20.350 --> 26:21.640
You've lost

26:21.640 --> 26:22.640
your best friend,

26:24.350 --> 26:26.350
and you've also given up on your son.

26:29.510 --> 26:30.720
At such a young age,

26:31.750 --> 26:33.030
you're making him travel

26:33.030 --> 26:34.510
all the way back to the Central Plains
from this place of exile?

26:34.510 --> 26:36.510
If the authorities want to catch him

26:36.790 --> 26:38.690
or the enemies come looking for him
in the future,

26:38.690 --> 26:40.750
do you think he'll be able to survive?

26:44.240 --> 26:46.300
You didn't even ask for a single penny

26:46.590 --> 26:47.440
and let that butler

26:47.440 --> 26:48.500
take your son away.

26:48.510 --> 26:49.110
Am I right?

26:54.160 --> 26:55.200
Just like you, Su

26:57.110 --> 26:58.640
risked his life

26:59.350 --> 27:00.680
to get the ginseng doll.

27:01.350 --> 27:01.920
He simply wanted

27:01.920 --> 27:02.720
his own son

27:02.720 --> 27:05.580
to return to the Central Plains
as soon as possible.

27:09.110 --> 27:10.510
You're both fathers.

27:12.050 --> 27:13.180
How could your heart

27:13.720 --> 27:15.160
be so cruel?

27:23.590 --> 27:24.240
Alright.

27:25.790 --> 27:26.720
Come back with me

27:27.550 --> 27:29.480
and give everyone an explanation.

27:31.350 --> 27:32.400
In this world,

27:33.880 --> 27:36.480
there's no debt
that doesn't need to be repaid.

27:37.070 --> 27:37.640
Get up.

27:46.640 --> 27:47.400
Hu?

27:53.550 --> 27:54.160
Si.

27:59.350 --> 28:00.070
Hu!

28:01.440 --> 28:02.330
Hu.

28:09.550 --> 28:09.960
Si...

28:28.510 --> 28:30.830
♪ As the big drum beats ♪

28:30.830 --> 28:32.760
♪ The sound echoes through the sky ♪

28:43.880 --> 28:47.740
♪ Those with poor fate
leave their hometown ♪

28:47.880 --> 28:51.570
♪ Following the horse gang to Heyang ♪

28:52.110 --> 28:55.550
♪ Having gone through
countless hardships ♪

28:56.000 --> 28:58.880
♪ Paying homage to ♪

28:59.350 --> 29:03.880
♪ The loyal and devoted Lord Guan ♪

29:12.030 --> 29:14.180
With auspiciousness, we travel the world.

29:13.550 --> 29:17.060
[Ningguta]

29:14.720 --> 29:17.680
Wealth keeps us safe!

29:20.270 --> 29:23.950
[Ningguta]

29:21.640 --> 29:22.960
Hear!

29:27.310 --> 29:30.150
[Horse Gang Merchant Caravan, Chang Si]

29:30.430 --> 29:32.230
[Ningguta]

29:32.550 --> 29:33.880
Something's not right.

29:36.760 --> 29:40.680
[Chang Yu'er, Daughter of Merchant
Chang Si of the Horse Gang]

29:42.700 --> 29:45.700
[Ningguta]

29:42.880 --> 29:43.590
Call out.

29:44.790 --> 29:47.160
Honorable officials
guarding the city gate!

29:46.460 --> 29:49.490
[Horse Gang Merchant Caravan, Heizi]

29:47.960 --> 29:50.790
We're a merchant caravan
here to purchase sea salt,

29:50.790 --> 29:52.650
the Jixiang Caravan from Shanxi.

29:53.630 --> 29:55.350
[Ningguta]

29:53.700 --> 29:55.400
Here's our salt license.

29:55.550 --> 29:56.880
Please lower the bridge and open the gate.

29:56.880 --> 29:58.160
After you check our license,

29:58.160 --> 30:01.470
[Ningguta]

29:58.200 --> 29:59.830
we can go find an inn to stay.

30:04.570 --> 30:05.990
[Ningguta]

30:10.360 --> 30:13.950
[Ningguta]

30:14.310 --> 30:14.770
Father.

30:15.310 --> 30:16.710
We can enter the city now.

30:17.920 --> 30:18.890
There's a cavalry.

30:18.890 --> 30:20.410
[Ningguta]

30:31.910 --> 30:33.620
[Ningguta]

30:54.030 --> 30:55.830
Disperse! Everyone, disperse!

30:56.350 --> 30:57.610
Put down your weapons!

30:59.750 --> 31:00.900
I said disperse!

31:01.000 --> 31:02.130
Quickly, disperse!

31:03.000 --> 31:04.440
It's Commander Xu's order that

31:04.440 --> 31:05.970
anyone who gathers to fight

31:06.240 --> 31:06.920
shall be killed!

31:06.260 --> 31:08.060
[Ningguta General]

31:11.920 --> 31:12.440
Mr. Gu.

31:14.350 --> 31:16.000
What is Liu Si's wife doing here?

31:16.000 --> 31:17.790
Isn't the situation bad enough already?

31:17.790 --> 31:19.640
Her husband and son both died.

31:20.070 --> 31:22.400
She insisted on coming here
for an explanation.

31:22.400 --> 31:23.160
If it weren't for Liu Si

31:23.160 --> 31:24.270
who sent his son away,

31:24.270 --> 31:25.440
the two settlements
wouldn't have gotten in such turmoil.

31:25.440 --> 31:26.680
You're right, Mr. Gu.

31:27.790 --> 31:28.670
Mrs. Su.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.180
Return the body first.

31:30.750 --> 31:32.180
His son didn't die.

31:32.400 --> 31:33.160
He ran away!

31:33.550 --> 31:34.960
We haven't settled this score yet!

31:34.960 --> 31:35.480
What,

31:35.880 --> 31:36.680
Mrs. Su,

31:36.920 --> 31:38.780
is there no room for negotiation?

31:39.510 --> 31:40.310
Hu, come here.

31:40.880 --> 31:42.280
Let me ask you something.

31:42.750 --> 31:44.080
Are you afraid of dying?

31:47.480 --> 31:48.550
I... I am.

31:51.070 --> 31:52.270
What did you just say?

31:53.680 --> 31:54.440
Mrs. Su.

31:56.550 --> 31:58.150
Don't push your luck too far.

31:58.640 --> 31:59.570
A life for a life.

32:00.200 --> 32:02.060
Liu Si has already paid the price.

32:02.510 --> 32:03.400
If you keep

32:03.400 --> 32:04.600
being so relentless,

32:05.000 --> 32:06.480
do you hope his hundred or so men

32:06.480 --> 32:08.140
to be buried together with Su?

32:09.240 --> 32:10.070
Su, throughout his life,

32:10.070 --> 32:11.130
was the most loyal.

32:11.240 --> 32:12.370
He cared for his men.

32:13.640 --> 32:14.550
If he knew from the afterlife

32:14.550 --> 32:15.590
and saw how you're acting now,

32:15.590 --> 32:17.050
acting purely on emotion,

32:17.480 --> 32:19.410
do you think he would rest in peace?

32:22.830 --> 32:23.690
How about this?

32:24.750 --> 32:26.150
You set some conditions.

32:27.310 --> 32:28.920
If there's anything
I can help you achieve,

32:28.920 --> 32:30.070
I'll definitely do it.

32:30.070 --> 32:30.800
Is that okay?

32:32.960 --> 32:35.690
You're determined to meddle in this,
aren't you?

32:36.790 --> 32:37.320
Yes, I am.

32:39.510 --> 32:41.110
Since we're all in Ningguta,

32:41.350 --> 32:43.010
we're all unfortunate souls.

32:43.920 --> 32:45.200
Please, take a step back.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.860
You must promise me one thing,

32:47.750 --> 32:49.350
and I'll leave immediately.

32:49.960 --> 32:50.550
As for Liu Si,

32:50.550 --> 32:52.110
I'll get his body ready for burial

32:52.110 --> 32:53.710
and return it respectfully.

32:56.110 --> 32:56.640
Go ahead.

32:59.000 --> 33:00.150
On the day you leave,

33:00.680 --> 33:02.280
I'll entrust my son's future

33:03.240 --> 33:04.500
to you.

33:05.480 --> 33:06.440
You can't let him

33:06.440 --> 33:07.830
stay here for the rest of his life.

33:07.830 --> 33:09.350
Take him out of here with you.

33:09.350 --> 33:11.350
You can have him do anything for you.

33:11.640 --> 33:12.700
Anything, really.

33:15.270 --> 33:15.800
Alright.

33:17.880 --> 33:18.810
Then make an oath

33:19.160 --> 33:20.360
to put my mind at ease.

33:33.170 --> 33:34.370
I, Gu Pingyuan, swear

33:36.400 --> 33:38.790
that if I ever return to
the Central Plains in this lifetime,

33:38.790 --> 33:41.110
I will definitely take this child with me.

33:41.110 --> 33:43.040
Any food I have will go to him first.

33:43.830 --> 33:44.830
Any clothes I have

33:45.550 --> 33:47.150
will be for him to wear first.

33:48.400 --> 33:49.350
I promise I'll

33:49.400 --> 33:51.000
raise him well to adulthood.

33:51.270 --> 33:52.400
If I break this oath,

33:52.830 --> 33:54.360
may I be struck by lightning

33:54.550 --> 33:55.510
and die young.

34:07.160 --> 34:09.150
Darling!

34:10.030 --> 34:12.630
How could you just die like that?

34:12.960 --> 34:16.760
You didn't even think about me
and our child!

34:38.280 --> 34:40.139
Who gave you permission to get up?

34:48.630 --> 34:50.690
Do you know what mistake you've made?

34:52.239 --> 34:52.840
I don't.

34:53.630 --> 34:54.400
You just

34:55.110 --> 34:56.750
took my seal like that

34:56.800 --> 34:57.920
and used it casually like a toy.

34:57.920 --> 34:58.710
How do you expect me,

34:58.710 --> 35:00.230
the garrison general,

35:01.280 --> 35:03.430
to sleep at night?

35:04.280 --> 35:06.340
I wish to help ease your worries, Sir.

35:10.700 --> 35:12.590
The dead can't be brought back,

35:13.150 --> 35:15.010
but what about that ginseng doll?

35:15.030 --> 35:16.560
Did you bring it back for me?

35:24.820 --> 35:25.760
What?

35:26.320 --> 35:27.510
In broad daylight,

35:27.990 --> 35:29.790
do you think you're that blessed

35:30.280 --> 35:31.920
to get to keep such a precious thing?

35:31.920 --> 35:33.780
I certainly aren't that blessed.

35:34.360 --> 35:35.170
But that doll,

35:35.280 --> 35:36.540
I really don't have it.

35:38.440 --> 35:39.590
I heard from the elders that

35:39.590 --> 35:40.990
it's a spiritual object.

35:41.880 --> 35:43.740
Only the virtuous can possess it.

35:46.480 --> 35:47.390
To sell it,

35:47.760 --> 35:49.250
Liu Si and Su Shuhe

35:49.440 --> 35:50.960
removed the red string tied to it

35:50.960 --> 35:52.150
and the needles on it.

35:52.150 --> 35:53.590
It then turned into a spirit

35:53.590 --> 35:54.360
and ran away.

35:57.690 --> 35:58.070
Sir!

35:58.070 --> 35:58.760
Do you even believe it yourself?

35:58.760 --> 36:00.220
Please spare my life, Sir!

36:00.230 --> 36:01.200
I don't know.

36:01.310 --> 36:02.230
Even if you cut off my head,

36:02.230 --> 36:03.490
I still wouldn't know.

36:03.760 --> 36:04.630
Please, Sir!

36:04.680 --> 36:05.400
Give me some more time

36:05.400 --> 36:07.800
to investigate thoroughly. I really will.

36:10.030 --> 36:11.710
Do you know who you are?

36:12.710 --> 36:13.510
I'm not human.

36:14.510 --> 36:15.260
I'm a ghost.

36:15.670 --> 36:17.330
You're the Mountain God, Sir.

36:17.630 --> 36:19.160
And I'm your servant ghost.

36:26.440 --> 36:27.890
I'm starving.

36:28.070 --> 36:29.110
Go find me food.

36:30.150 --> 36:30.710
Get lost.

36:38.070 --> 36:38.960
Put the carts against the wall

36:38.960 --> 36:39.880
after unloading the goods!

36:39.880 --> 36:41.150
Feed the mules in the back!

36:41.150 --> 36:41.590
Got it!

36:41.590 --> 36:42.670
Stack the boxes according to
the "Heaven, Earth, Black, Yellow" code.

36:42.670 --> 36:43.670
Don't mix them up!

36:43.800 --> 36:44.840
Got it!

36:45.840 --> 36:46.880
Stack them properly.

36:46.880 --> 36:47.800
Check them up.

36:56.510 --> 36:57.760
You've never learned
how to heat a brick bed.

36:57.760 --> 36:58.960
Why do you have to try?

37:17.230 --> 37:18.630
Which of you is Mr. Chang?

37:22.110 --> 37:23.190
I am.

37:24.190 --> 37:25.190
May I have your name, Sir?

37:25.190 --> 37:26.360
I am Gu Pingyuan.

37:26.400 --> 37:27.730
I work for Commander Xu.

37:27.800 --> 37:29.060
I came here for a visit.

37:29.510 --> 37:30.040
Alright.

37:30.630 --> 37:31.630
This way, please.

37:45.400 --> 37:45.960
Miss.

37:47.190 --> 37:48.630
The brick bed and the brick stove
are connected.

37:48.630 --> 37:49.510
When you're cooking on the stove,

37:49.510 --> 37:50.550
the room will be warmed up as well.

37:50.550 --> 37:52.550
Careful, the smoke could choke you.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.820
Come on in, please.

38:07.280 --> 38:08.080
Have some tea.

38:10.030 --> 38:10.800
What kind of business

38:10.800 --> 38:11.760
do you do, Mr. Chang?

38:11.760 --> 38:12.840
The New Year is approaching,

38:12.840 --> 38:14.800
yet you went on this trip
with so many people.

38:14.800 --> 38:17.480
I make a living by running the horse gang,
so it's a four-season business.

38:17.480 --> 38:18.800
My wife died early.

38:19.000 --> 38:21.280
I had to raise my daughter
while operating the caravans.

38:21.280 --> 38:22.080
As I got older,

38:22.670 --> 38:24.190
I bought a house and some land.

38:24.190 --> 38:25.320
I didn't expect that

38:25.360 --> 38:26.880
since I traveled around my whole life,

38:26.880 --> 38:28.070
I never learned how to manage farms,

38:28.070 --> 38:29.110
and there was a famine.

38:29.110 --> 38:30.630
So I gathered my old employees

38:30.630 --> 38:33.690
to come beyond the pass
to transport some sea salt back.

38:41.230 --> 38:42.550
My creditors are stressing me,
and I think we can make it back

38:42.550 --> 38:44.810
before the New Year
if we push up the pace.

38:45.230 --> 38:46.360
When you're away from home,

38:46.360 --> 38:47.890
you have to rely on friends.

38:48.360 --> 38:48.960
Mr. Gu,

38:49.190 --> 38:51.320
any advice or guidance you can give me,

38:51.590 --> 38:53.120
I'd be deeply grateful for.

38:53.200 --> 38:54.840
You're an experienced businessman,
Mr. Chang.

38:54.840 --> 38:56.320
I can hardly offer you
any guidance or advice,

38:56.320 --> 38:57.880
and I'm not worthy of being called "Sir."

38:57.880 --> 38:58.880
I'm just an exile.

38:59.590 --> 39:01.440
Knowing that I'm literate
and good at accounting,

39:01.440 --> 39:02.640
Commander Xu asked me

39:02.800 --> 39:05.600
to help receive the travelling merchants
for him.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.480
Mr. Chang, do you know

39:08.070 --> 39:09.130
what place this is?

39:09.800 --> 39:10.440
Ningguta.

39:10.710 --> 39:11.510
That's right.

39:11.880 --> 39:12.550
The exiles

39:12.710 --> 39:14.070
are sent all the way here,

39:14.070 --> 39:16.400
and only by sheer luck could they survive.

39:16.840 --> 39:17.480
On the way here,

39:17.480 --> 39:19.440
did you see the settlements outside?

39:19.440 --> 39:20.880
They're all military settlements.

39:20.880 --> 39:22.510
That's where they are assigned.

39:22.510 --> 39:23.730
The strong ones

39:23.840 --> 39:25.440
go hunting in the mountains,

39:25.440 --> 39:26.190
hunting wolves,

39:26.190 --> 39:26.880
tigers,

39:27.280 --> 39:28.280
and bears.

39:28.840 --> 39:30.710
Whether they live or die doesn't matter.

39:30.710 --> 39:32.590
What matters is that
the wild animals stay alive,

39:32.590 --> 39:33.520
to be put in cages

39:33.550 --> 39:35.410
and taken to Mulan Hunting Ground

39:35.510 --> 39:36.370
for the Emperor

39:36.510 --> 39:38.440
and princes to hunt.

39:39.630 --> 39:40.980
Others dig for ginseng.

39:41.190 --> 39:43.630
They forage in the mountains
all year round.

39:43.630 --> 39:44.920
With the slightest carelessness,

39:44.920 --> 39:45.670
they become

39:45.880 --> 39:47.630
food for wild beasts.

39:50.360 --> 39:52.320
This is truly no place for humans.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.640
But here in Ningguta,

39:55.070 --> 39:57.400
there are people even more cruel than God.

39:58.590 --> 39:59.320
You've got to

40:00.230 --> 40:01.290
show some respect.

40:02.920 --> 40:04.050
Thanks a lot, Mr. Gu.

40:15.280 --> 40:16.610
Miss, did you ask for me?

40:17.410 --> 40:18.740
Drop the pleasantries.

40:19.840 --> 40:21.500
Do you know how to build a fire?

40:26.670 --> 40:27.520
See, the logs

40:27.590 --> 40:29.150
should be stacked up like this.

40:29.150 --> 40:30.880
Don't put them over the flames,

40:30.880 --> 40:31.760
or there will be

40:31.760 --> 40:32.730
a lot of smoke.

40:34.590 --> 40:35.520
Lesson learned.

40:36.110 --> 40:37.440
They wouldn't teach me,

40:37.440 --> 40:39.040
and they often make fun of me.

40:43.320 --> 40:44.280
In less than an hour,

40:44.280 --> 40:45.810
this room will be warmed up.

40:50.880 --> 40:52.680
Are you an official or a soldier?

40:56.080 --> 40:56.960
I'm a convict.

41:10.840 --> 41:11.800
A bowl of wine, please.

41:11.800 --> 41:16.590
♪ My love, keep your voice down ♪

41:16.590 --> 41:18.590
♪ I'll go get the door ♪

41:19.550 --> 41:21.600
♪ Greet me with a big smile ♪

41:22.480 --> 41:23.880
♪ I hold my darling's hands ♪

41:23.030 --> 41:24.840
[Manchun Brothel]

41:23.880 --> 41:24.630
Screw you!

41:27.590 --> 41:32.840
♪ I keep calling his name ♪

41:33.840 --> 41:39.000
♪ I take him to my boudoir at midnight ♪

41:39.360 --> 41:40.010
Mr. Li,

41:40.440 --> 41:42.100
is this some sort of exercise?

41:45.070 --> 41:46.520
What exercise?

41:47.110 --> 41:48.340
Give me a hand.

41:53.280 --> 41:54.540
Where are you clothes?

41:55.440 --> 41:56.770
I just gambled in there.

41:56.800 --> 41:58.230
A guy tricked me.

41:58.880 --> 42:00.690
I got a pair of tiger heads,

42:00.920 --> 42:02.960
while my match got two bronze hammers.

42:02.960 --> 42:03.830
But he insisted

42:04.030 --> 42:06.290
that I lost according to the local rules.

42:06.710 --> 42:07.760
He took all my money

42:07.760 --> 42:08.620
and my clothes.

42:12.190 --> 42:12.980
Wait, wait.

42:12.620 --> 42:14.410
[Manchun Brothel]

42:13.070 --> 42:14.000
Coat. Coat.

42:14.190 --> 42:15.920
Give me your coat.

42:19.670 --> 42:20.530
Come in with me.

42:20.880 --> 42:22.550
Let's get your clothes back first.

42:22.550 --> 42:23.680
Get my clothes back?

42:23.740 --> 42:27.620
[Manchun Brothel]

42:25.840 --> 42:26.280
Mr. Gu,

42:26.800 --> 42:28.000
want to have fun here?

42:28.030 --> 42:29.130
Come on in, please.

42:30.480 --> 42:31.230
"Mr. Gu?"

42:33.030 --> 42:34.600
Mr. Gu! Mr. Gu!

42:40.710 --> 42:41.360
Just do it.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.190
Show the dices.

42:42.190 --> 42:42.790
Show them.

42:46.800 --> 42:47.400
Were you

42:47.400 --> 42:48.870
tricked by this guy?

42:50.230 --> 42:50.760
Yes.

42:50.800 --> 42:52.360
Among all Heaven and Earth spirits,

42:52.360 --> 42:54.150
the Gambling God is the most powerful.

42:54.150 --> 42:55.760
Little dice spirits carry the ingots,

42:55.760 --> 42:57.910
one by one into the door.

42:58.190 --> 42:59.050
Claim them all!

43:00.040 --> 43:02.950
[Su Zixuan]
